the next real halt is silent again (L1.43). A steady 5,000 that turns over daily is healthy; a
steady 5,000 that never moves is a stall wearing a number. Two breaches: coverage going
BACKWARDS past a tolerance (L1.50, the ratchet), and unjudged_total not falling across 6
readings spanning 3h while cells remain unjudged.

IT CAPS NOTHING AND RATIONS NOTHING, and a test pins that: judging more cells is free in
multiplicity terms, so there is no reason to ration what reaches the judge and this fence never
proposes one. It exists to make the desk judge MORE by making a stall visible in one pass
instead of never.

